OL,3,AUS basketball player arrested with 34kg
OL,4,Aof cannabis at Nigerian airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FA basketball player from the US has
OL,7,Fbeen arrested in Nigeria with 33.95kg
OL,8,F(75lbs) of cannabis in his luggage at
OL,9,Fthe main airport in Lagos.
OL,11,FThe National Drug Law Enforcement
OL,12,FAgency (NDLEA) identified the player as
OL,13,FGreene Da'monte Khiree, 28, from the US
OL,14,Fstate of Georgia, who it said had
OL,15,Farrived from Thailand via the United
OL,16,FArab Emirates.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
