OL,3,AUS basketball player arrested with 34kg
OL,4,Aof cannabis at Nigerian airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the agency, the suspect
OL,7,Fsaid he had been playing professional
OL,8,Fbasketball in Thailand and was visiting
OL,9,Fto Nigeria to "build networks" for his
OL,10,Fcareer. He has not publicly commented
OL,11,Fon the allegations.
OL,13,FThe agency said an examination of the
OL,14,Fsuspect's phone had pointed "to his
OL,15,Fknowledge of and involvement in the
OL,16,Fdrug trafficking activity".
